@startuml
[*] --> PENDING : created
PENDING --> ASSIGNED : MarsColony accepts and reserves agents/resources
PENDING --> FAILED : rejected / invalid requirements
ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS : Simulation starts mission and moves assigned agents
IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : duration reached
IN_PROGRESS --> FAILED : hazard / depleted battery / equipment failure
COMPLETED --> [*] : release agents
FAILED --> [*] : record reason / release agents
@enduml
